  "title": "CLMS Soil Water Index (SWI) Timeseries Global 12.5km V4 (NetCDF)",
  "description": "Reformats the daily Soil Water Index 0.1° into a time series format, which makes it easier to perform local, time series-based analysis without having to download and convert data for the whole globe. The time series covers the period from 1st January 2007 to the present. The SWI time series product is updated every six months, in July and in January.",
